#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/network.md:10
msgid "CAN, Ethernet frames and MDIO"
msgstr "CAN、以太网帧与 MDIO"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/network.md:12
msgid ""
"These interfaces expose bounded bus frames, MAC observations and PHY "
"register access. They do not create a protocol stack or establish Board "
"wiring, PHY timing or physical network performance."
msgstr "这些接口提供有界总线帧、MAC 观测及 PHY 寄存器访问，不创建协议栈，也不证明板级接线、PHY 时序或物理网络性能。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/network.md:16
msgid "Public declarations"
msgstr "公共声明"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/network.md:18
msgid "can.h"
msgstr "can.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/network.md:20
msgid "Classic CAN value frames and caller-owned TX requests."
msgstr "Classic CAN 值帧与调用者拥有的 TX 请求。"

