msgid "Typedefs"
msgstr "类型定义"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/network.md:20
msgid "Protocol error category stored in one byte, never a silicon code."
msgstr "以一字节存储的协议错误类别，不是芯片编码。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/network.md:20
msgid ""
"BIT_RECESSIVE/DOMINANT name the level the transmitter intended. UNKNOWN "
"means no classified observation is available. These categories do not "
"identify the affected frame or prove a current bus condition."
msgstr ""
"BIT_RECESSIVE／DOMINANT 表示发送者原本要发送的电平。UNKNOWN "
"表示没有可分类观测。这些类别不标识受影响帧，也不证明总线当前状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/network.md:20
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/network.md:26
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/network.md:38
msgid "Enums"
msgstr "枚举"

